<section class="section what" aria-labelledby="what-title">
  <div class="measure">
    <h2 id="what-title" class="t-title">Your storage, as a drive in Finder.</h2>
    <div class="what__body">
      <p>
        Syncophant adds your storage to Finder as a location of its own. Folders open like any other folder, and your
        apps save to it like any other disk.
      </p>
      <p>
        Files download when you open them, so a 20 GB archive takes no space on your Mac until you need it. Keep a
        folder on this Mac when you want it offline.
      </p>
      <p>Your files stay in Finder even after you quit the menu bar app.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .what__body {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
  .what__body p:first-child {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
